    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0001",
      "source": "The [`AVCaptureTimecodeGenerator`](avcapturetimecodegenerator.md) class supports multiple timecode sources, including frame counting, system clock synchronization, and MIDI timecode input (MTC).",
      "ko": "[`AVCaptureTimecodeGenerator`](avcapturetimecodegenerator.md) 클래스는 프레임 카운팅, 시스템 시계 동기화, MIDI timecode 입력(MTC)을 비롯한 여러 timecode 소스를 지원합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "e5423a6527b2fb8802a76eac6c1e5c881eda2e3f7dd1de5a11cec92fb19a6877",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0008:0002",
      "source": "Suitable for playback, recording, or other time-sensitive operations where precise timecode metadata is required.",
      "ko": "정밀한 timecode 메타데이터가 필요한 재생, 녹화 또는 기타 시간 민감 작업에 적합합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "23ba42f57fb4a388927c0f1103f9aaa62ed6d576752d6d6ac582816f2d655184",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:overview:0009:0001",
      "source": "Use the [`startSynchronization(source:)`](avcapturetimecodegenerator/startsynchronization(source:).md) method to set up the desired timecode source.",
      "ko": "원하는 timecode 소스를 구성하려면 [`startSynchronization(source:)`](avcapturetimecodegenerator/startsynchronization(source:).md) 메서드를 사용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b84b605dca893f4dcb1ed8c8c0c1d0bb9fa7c829f97c8e6078557151dc66da16",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
